2.6.3. One-sided captive cellular automata
We consider the family of captive cellular automata F : AZ → AZ of neighbourhood {0, 1}, which
means that the local rule f : A{0,1} → A satisfies f (a0 a1 ) ∈ {a0 , a1 }. See Figure 1 for an example
of space-time diagram.
