   Our results apply on automata with simple defects dynamics, namely, automata admitting a
particle system with P = {±1} and whose update function corresponds to a gliders automaton. We
first prove our results for gliders automata before generalising them in Section 3.6. Let us introduce
some tools that turn the study of the dynamics of a gliders automaton into the study of some
random walk.
