   Using (3) and (4), we see that the right-hand term in (2a) converges to π2 arctan      v+ −v− +v+ α
as ε → 0. The left-hand term in (2b) can be bounded from above by the same method. We apply
this result to (1a) and (1b) by taking ε = √3n (resp. √4n ), and the theorem follows.                 
